<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Amway 1st half net up 32.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Amway 1st half net up 32.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Feb 28,1997</p>
<p>			(In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr	     (cents)	36.4	 vs	  27.4</p>
<p>    Net profit		     36.36	vs	  27.41</p>
<p>    Turnover			172.11	vs	 133.16</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		 54.17	vs	  39.78</p>
<p>NOTE - The full name of the company is Amway (Malaysia) Holdings Bhd. It is involved in distribution of consumer products in Malaysia.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
